KantoAirport_Text_FlyToHoenn::
    .string "Welcome to VERMILION AIRPORT! This\n"
    .string "is the counter for flights to\l"
    .string "HOENN.\p"
    .string "The next flight lands at SLATEPORT\n"
    .string "CITY. The POKéMON LEAGUE pays the\l"
    .string "fare for CHAMPIONS.\p"
    .string "Would you like to board now?$"

KantoAirport_Text_Boarding::
    .string "Thank you! Please proceed to the\n"
    .string "gate. Enjoy your flight!$"

KantoAirport_Text_ChampionsOnly::
    .string "Welcome to VERMILION AIRPORT!\p"
    .string "I'm sorry, but flights to HOENN\n"
    .string "are only open to POKéMON LEAGUE\l"
    .string "CHAMPIONS for now.$"

KantoAirport_Text_ComeAgain::
    .string "We hope to see you again soon!$"

KantoAirport_Text_JohtoSoon::
    .string "Flights to JOHTO will begin soon.\n"
    .string "The runway at OLIVINE is still\l"
    .string "being built!$"

KantoAirport_Text_Info::
    .string "Flights to HOENN leave from the\n"
    .string "first counter on the left.\p"
    .string "To come back to KANTO, look for\n"
    .string "our counter at SLATEPORT HARBOR.\p"
    .string "A word of warning: HOENN's sky\n"
    .string "routes aren't charted yet.\p"
    .string "Over there, FLY only carries you\n"
    .string "home to a KANTO town.$"

KantoAirport_Text_Traveler::
    .string "HOENN has POKéMON you'll never see\n"
    .string "in KANTO! I'm off to find a\l"
    .string "MUDKIP!$"

KantoAirport_Text_Woman::
    .string "I love watching the planes take\n"
    .string "off from the big windows. It never\l"
    .string "gets old!$"

